<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82546" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιχάσκω</span></b> , aor. 2
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιέχᾰνον</span> and pf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περικέχηνα</span> (as if from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιχαίνω</span>, which is
			post-classical):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>open the mouth wide, gape</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				2.26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.194S.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>open</i> a girdle, <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				48.58.5
			</span></i> (s.v.l.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>close the jaws over, take into the mouth</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				604b18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				10.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				<u>Eup.</u>
				2.138
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Merc.Cond.</u>
				3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				4.33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hippiatr.</u>
				119
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὸν ἀέρα</span>
			<i>snap at</i> the air, of a lion, <i><span class="en">
				Ach.Tat.
				2.22
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
